== DevSecOps Pipeline Design
#figure(caption: "DevSecOps Pipeline Design", table(
  columns: 3,
  table.header([*Pipeline Stage*], [*Security Acvitity / Control*], [*Security Verfication / Output*]),

  [PLAN],
  [Defining the scope of the application, access control matrix and conduct STRIDE analysis.],
  [Documented architecture plan, asset register and threat model cmomitted in this appendix.],

  [CODE],
  [Use secure design principles (least privilege, safe default fallback values) and IDE-based code analysis.],
  [Commits introducing authentication, authorization as well as logic controls of the expected values.],

  [BUILD],
  [Perform a dependency analysis - compare to a specific version digest.],
  [Fail build in case version digest has changed.],

  [TEST],
  [Run authorization tests, especially test whether the signature verification of the JWT works.],
  [Fail in case a regression was introduced, causing the authorization checks to pass in unintended cases. Save the result as artifacts.],

  [RELEASE],
  [Evaluate results from build / test case before performing a release.],
  [Block release in case build / test results are negative.],

  [DEPLOY],
  [Deploy microservices in separate containers to ensure isolation of processes.],
  [Docker Compose Configuration defining the microservices as destinct services using an internal network.],

  [OPERATE],
  table.cell(colspan: 2)[N/A -- Application not production ready yet.],
))

== Security Gates
#figure(caption: "Security Gates", table(
  columns: (20%, auto, auto, auto),
  table.header([*Gate*], [*Security Check*], [*Failure Condition*], [*Pipeline Action*]),

  [Gate 1: Dependency Analysis (Build)],
  [Verify the version digest of the dependencies upon installation (specifically install the previously verified version).],
  [Version digest of a dependency differs from the expected value.],
  [Immediately stop pipeline, as a dependency might be compromised.],

  [Gate 2: Build],
  [Verify successful build of all microservices.],
  [At least one microservice fails to build.],
  [Stop further stages, as they cannot run successful without all microservices],

  [Gate 3: Test],
  [Run tests to check functionality of application.],
  [At least one test result differs from the expected result.],
  [Block merge / release.],
))